!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="my">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>For You</title>
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #fce4ec;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            font-family: sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .box {
            background: white;
            padding: 25px 35px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            text-align: center;
        }
        h3 {
            color: #d81b60;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        button {
            padding: 10px 25px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 20px;
            background: #ff4081;
            color: white;
            font-size: 16px;
            cursor: pointer;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }
        button:hover {
            background: #f50057;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="box">
        <h3>ငါတို့ တစ်ကစနေ ပြန်စဥ်းစားမလား</h3>
        <button onclick="alert('Yay! ❤️')">Yes</button>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
